    "text": "Without Beth, the house is {EMPTY}. Jo tries to take her place, cheerful and {USEFUL}, but up in the garret she lays her head on the {RAGBAG} and cries. She feels {LONELY}, with no one to love her best. Marmee {COMFORTS} her, and says, gently, “Write {SOMETHING}.”",
